import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 404 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Plot-Kidnapping-Setting Cases: The Typical Forced-Breakthrough-for-Plot","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 404 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Plot-Kidnapping-Setting Cases: The Typical Forced-Breakthrough-for-Plot","no":404,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Plot-Kidnapping-Setting","Forced Breakthrough","Protagonist Halo"],"related":["09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance","97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0404_模块2-莽荒纪-剧情绑架设定案例-为剧情强行突破的典型.md","filePath":"en/0404_模块2-莽荒纪-剧情绑架设定案例-为剧情强行突破的典型.md"}'),a={name:"en/0404_模块2-莽荒纪-剧情绑架设定案例-为剧情强行突破的典型.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-404-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-plot-kidnapping-setting-cases-the-typical-forced-breakthrough-for-plot" tabindex="-1">Entry 404 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Plot-Kidnapping-Setting Cases: The Typical Forced-Breakthrough-for-Plot <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-404-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-plot-kidnapping-setting-cases-the-typical-forced-breakthrough-for-plot" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 404 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Plot-Kidnapping-Setting Cases: The Typical Forced-Breakthrough-for-Plot&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 9) | Benchmark base: Documents 09, 97, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-time-to-break-through-matters-more-than-time-to-cultivate" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when &quot;time to break through&quot; matters more than &quot;time to cultivate&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-time-to-break-through-matters-more-than-time-to-cultivate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when &quot;time to break through&quot; matters more than &quot;time to cultivate&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> states clearly: plot must not kidnap setting; setting self-consistency above plot convenience. Manghuang Ji is a dense sample of &quot;plot kidnapping setting&quot; — whenever Ji Ning falls into a plot desperate situation, the early hard-won iron rules like &quot;requires millennia of hard-cultivation,&quot; &quot;requires heaven-earth treasures,&quot; &quot;requires comprehension epiphany,&quot; are one-click broken by &quot;life-death moment epiphany,&quot; &quot;natal divine ability awakening,&quot; &quot;cave-heaven adventure&quot; tropes. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Plot-kidnapping-setting&#39;s direct cost is early hard-cultivation buildup wasted: the realms Ji Ning methodically accumulates early become dispensable after a few &quot;epiphany breakthroughs&quot; — since at a desperate moment he can surge, what meaning does ordinary hard-cultivation have? <strong>Cultivation&#39;s seriousness is overdrafted by plot; readers&#39; trust in &quot;effort&quot; is repeatedly consumed.</strong> This is narrative-tier energy waste.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How plot-kidnapping-setting makes civilizational cognition regress:</p><ol><li><strong>Rules unpredictable</strong>: readers cannot judge &quot;what situations allow breakthrough,&quot; because breakthrough conditions swing with plot emotion</li><li><strong>Effort devalued</strong>: since epiphany exceeds hard-cultivation, other cultivators&#39; millennia of hard-cultivation in the civilization becomes a joke</li><li><strong>Chance overwhelms necessity</strong>: civilization evolution relies on &quot;protagonist adventure&quot; not &quot;law regularity&quot;; knowledge cannot be inherited</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind plot-kidnapping-setting is the protagonist&#39;s monopoly of &quot;rule-exception right&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Others hard-cultivate, he epiphanizes</strong>: the same realm, others need a millennium; Ji Ning breaks through on the line of life and death — rules work for others, not for him</li><li><strong>Natal divine ability&#39;s plot summons</strong>: every time a comeback is needed, a new divine ability, new transformation happens to awaken</li><li><strong>Fortune as privilege</strong>: narrative packages &quot;protagonist halo&quot; as fortune; essentially a privilege above law</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Plot Kidnapping</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Law Precedence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Desperate-moment epiphany breakthrough</td><td>Each realm&#39;s promotion conditions legislated first; epiphany must also meet recomputable standards</td></tr><tr><td>Natal divine ability plot-summoned</td><td>Divine-ability development via deduction-iteration system; researchable and verifiable</td></tr><tr><td>Rules swing with the protagonist</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table: any breakthrough first passes self-consistency check</td></tr><tr><td>Effort devalued</td><td>Reality-as-foundation: accumulation is hard currency; no plot-tier skipping accepted</td></tr><tr><td>Fortune as privilege</td><td>Law anchors rights universal-benefited to all; no one enjoys rule exception</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Manghuang&#39;s &quot;hard-cultivation time — epiphany-breakthrough count&quot; curve; count early-iron-rule-break trope density</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare &quot;plot-tier breakthrough,&quot; &quot;law-tier breakthrough,&quot; &quot;Anchor promotion-conditions injected&quot; three modes</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: early iron-rule survival rate, readers&#39; trust in &quot;effort,&quot; breakthrough-condition predictability</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — under plot-tier breakthrough, iron-rule survival rate under 20%; law-tier breakthrough maintains over 90%</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. Breakthrough conditions swing with plot emotion; no stable recomputable rules</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Plot-kidnapping is retcon&#39;s pre-symptom; once accustomed to changing rules for plot, late inevitably comprehensively collapses</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. All rule-exception rights concentrate on Ji Ning alone; others cannot enjoy</li></ul><p>What plot-kidnapping-setting hurts most is actually other characters. When Ji Ning can always epiphany-comeback at life-death moments, those supporting characters who methodically hard-cultivated a millennium become a joke — their effort is worthless before the protagonist&#39;s plot needs. Readers thrill on the surface, but inside know: this set of rules only works for the protagonist. Heng Yuan Zhou legislating breakthrough conditions is precisely to make supporting characters&#39; effort also count, to make millennia of hard-cultivation not the protagonist&#39;s footnote, but a path anyone can repeat. Once rules only protect the protagonist, the blood of others in the civilization was shed in vain.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early hard-cultivation buildup overdrafted by epiphany tropes</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: protagonist monopolizes &quot;rule-exception right&quot;; others hard-cultivate while he epiphanizes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system at least breakthrough has clear thresholds; Manghuang&#39;s threshold moves with plot</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: rule-exception right belongs to the protagonist alone; Myriad Ranks forever hard-cultivate by old rules</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a worldview with unstable rules, the more expanded the more loopholes</li></ul><p>Plot-kidnapping-setting also has a side effect: it makes the word &quot;effort&quot; cheap in Manghuang. Readers seeing Ji Ning epiphany-comeback, think not &quot;this is the result of his effort,&quot; but &quot;anyway the protagonist will win.&quot; Once effort decouples from result, other hard-cultivators&#39; images in the civilization all blur. Heng Yuan Zhou legislating breakthrough conditions is to make effort hard currency again — meet conditions and you can break through, not meet and you cannot, regardless of who you are. Equality before rules is the respect for effort.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Breakthrough for the thrill&quot; is web-literature&#39;s old ailment; Manghuang just takes it to the extreme. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s stance is hard: breakthrough can be exciting, but must be exciting within the law framework. Once rules start yielding to plot, readers will no longer believe in this world — and a world no one believes, however lively, is a castle in the air.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · plot-kidnapping-setting cases · typical forced-breakthrough-for-plot described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./403_模块2-莽荒纪-吃书烂尾分析-后期设定推翻与吞噬星空联动矛盾.html">Entry 403 · Retcon-Ending Analysis</a> · <a href="./405_模块2-莽荒纪-设定自洽度评估-中低自洽度的量化.html">Entry 405 · Setting-Self-Consistency Assessment</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
